{"id":6765,"date":"2020-02-15T22:57:32","date_gmt":"2020-02-16T03:57:32","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=6765"},"modified":"2020-02-16T00:10:09","modified_gmt":"2020-02-16T05:10:09","slug":"mexico-day-two","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2020\/02\/15\/mexico-day-two\/","title":{"rendered":"Mexico Day Two"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>We (Group 1) left Potrero Park at 7:30 a.m. Our group is the Parking Group so we need to head out before any of the other groups so we can be in place at the next location far enough ahead so we can be set up and ready to Park all the other rigs coming in behind us. There are 3 other groups consisting of 5 or 6 rigs each.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Since we all have our FMM cards already, we COULD have been swept right through the border crossing. But Kathy and I weren&#8217;t so lucky.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The official stopped us, checked our registrations, looked in a couple cabinets, and then greeted us with &#8220;Happy Valentine&#8217;s Day&#8221;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We moved on through the gates and all 6 rigs in Group One stayed in touch on our CB radios as we traveled the next 50 or so miles down to Zoologico Parque del Nino in Guadalupe Baja California Mexico.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Once we arrived, our fearless Group One (parking group) leaders Jim and Connie gave us our instructions along with our bright orange safety vests and flags.  We we&#8217;re now official parking team members! <\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_135727-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6774\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_135727-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_135727-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_135727-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_135727-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_135727-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_135727.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>Our official uniforms<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>We then spent the next couple hours greeting and parking rigs as each subsequent group rolled in.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We we&#8217;re the first rig in so we got the prime spot in  the corner closest to the wolves and the lion!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_140826-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6775\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_140826-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_140826-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_140826-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_140826-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_140826-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_140826-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_140826-2000x1500.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_140826.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>Right up front closest to the action<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>After we got all the rigs parked, we all wandered over to Ed &amp; Kassandra&#8217;s (Our Trip Leaders) rig to pick up our new Baja jackets and get an update on the schedule for the coming days.  Ed talked a little about the history of the Baja Jacket and his design for the logo embroidered onto the front.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-1 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_154248-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6777\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6777\" class=\"wp-image-6777\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_154248-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_154248-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_154248-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_154248-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_154248-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_154248-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_154248-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_154248-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Ed talks about the history of the Baja Jacket<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_155429-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6778\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6778\" class=\"wp-image-6778\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_155429-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_155429-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_155429-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_155429-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_155429-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_155429-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_155429-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_155429-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">Handing out our new hooded jackets<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_151203-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6779\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_151203-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C1440&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6779\" class=\"wp-image-6779\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_151203-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_151203-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_151203-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_151203-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_151203-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_151203-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_151203-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_151203-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-item__caption\">The White Board with upcoming activities<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><figcaption class=\"blocks-gallery-caption\">Passing out our new 2020 Baja Jackets<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Right after the afternoon meeting we moved on into the zoo where we were gifted with a beautiful Valentines Dinner prepared by the park owners daughter who is also a recently graduated chef!  The meal was a delicious dish of Mexican Lasagna with green salad and refried beans served with fresh sangria or a unique cucumber\/lemon drink and topped off with Red Velvet cupcakes.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_164145-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6780\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_164145-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C1440&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6780\" class=\"wp-image-6780\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_164145-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_164145-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_164145-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_164145-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_164145-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_164145-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_164145-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_164145-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_164428-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6781\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_164428-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C1440&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6781\" class=\"wp-image-6781\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_164428-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_164428-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_164428-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_164428-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_164428-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_164428-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_164428-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_164428-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165515-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6782\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i1.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165515-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C1440&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6782\" class=\"wp-image-6782\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165515-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165515-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165515-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165515-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165515-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165515-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165515-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165515-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165535-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6783\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i2.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165535-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C1440&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6783\" class=\"wp-image-6783\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165535-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165535-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165535-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165535-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165535-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165535-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165535-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165535-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"760\" height=\"428\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165619-scaled.jpg?fit=685%2C385&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"6784\" data-full-url=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165619-scaled.jpg?fit=2560%2C1440&amp;ssl=1\" data-link=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?attachment_id=6784\" class=\"wp-image-6784\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165619-scaled.jpg 760w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165619-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165619-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165619-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165619-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165619-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165619-685x385.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/02\/IMG_20200214_165619-2000x1125.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px\" \/><\/figure><\/li><\/ul><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>And another special treat of the night was a gift from Malcolm Russ &#8211; one of our own who, as it turns out is a retired professional musician and vocalist who has played in national orchestras as well as smaller venues all over the country.  He took requests, while also giving us some great love songs to bring the evening to a close.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Day three brings us a personal guided tour of the zoo with a close-up look at the animals with led by one of the two zoo biologists.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Stand by for more!<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We (Group 1) left Potrero Park at 7:30 a.m. Our group is the Parking Group so we need to head out before any of the other groups so we can be in place at the next location far enough ahead so we can be set up and ready to Park all the other rigs coming &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2020\/02\/15\/mexico-day-two\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Mexico Day Two<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[490,554707839,586,677,264,554707836,554707329],"tags":[554707843,554707842,554707844,783,6117],"class_list":["post-6765","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-animals","category-escapees","category-food","category-friends","category-learning","category-mexico","category-traveling","tag-baja-jacket","tag-guadalupe","tag-mexican-lasagna","tag-mexico","tag-zoo"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/6765","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=6765"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/6765\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":6788,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/6765\/revisions\/6788"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=6765"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=6765"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=6765"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}